{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":3,"title":"대각선 합","desc":"<p>정사각 행렬의 <b>주 대각선(왼쪽 위 → 오른쪽 아래) 원소의 합</b>을 돌려주는 <code>diag_sum(m)</code>을 만드세요.</p>","solution":"diag_sum <- function(m) {\n  sum(diag(m))\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>diag(m)</code> 이 대각선 원소를 꺼내 줘요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"diag_sum(matrix(1:4, nrow = 2))","expected":5,"visible":true},{"call":"diag_sum(matrix(1:9, nrow = 3))","expected":15,"visible":true},{"call":"diag_sum(matrix(5, 1, 1))","expected":5,"visible":false},{"call":"diag_sum(matrix(0, 2, 2))","expected":0,"visible":false}],"starter":"diag_sum <- function(m) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-340"}